# T21 spot check B15 (missed-checkpoint notice): Quick Race on Backyard Bash, steering assist off
# (default), the car veers left off the grid so that it crosses the start line's s west of its
# gate (start straight: centre x 44, half width 5 + off-road margin 6, open lawn to the west) →
# "Missed checkpoint — go back" in the HUD. Three attempts (Restart between) with different steering;
# a screenshot every 0.25 s after GO. Gamepad for analog steering (single player owns every device).
wait ui
wait screen title
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
wait screen main
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quick Race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait screen trackSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Sofa Circuit
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Backyard Bash
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # select → Choose car
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # → Car select
wait screen carSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # race
wait racing
hold gamepad throttle 1
hold gamepad steer -1
@30 hold gamepad steer 0
@45 shot b15_a_045
@60 shot b15_a_060
@75 shot b15_a_075
@90 shot b15_a_090
@105 shot b15_a_105
@120 shot b15_a_120
@135 shot b15_a_135
@150 shot b15_a_150
@180 shot b15_a_180
@210 shot b15_a_210
@240 shot b15_a_240
release gamepad
0.2 tap keyboardA pause
wait screen pause
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Restart
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait countdown
wait racing
hold gamepad throttle 1
hold gamepad steer -1
@50 hold gamepad steer 0
@60 shot b15_b_060
@75 shot b15_b_075
@90 shot b15_b_090
@105 shot b15_b_105
@120 shot b15_b_120
@135 shot b15_b_135
@150 shot b15_b_150
@180 shot b15_b_180
@210 shot b15_b_210
@240 shot b15_b_240
release gamepad
0.2 tap keyboardA pause
wait screen pause
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Restart
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait countdown
wait racing
hold gamepad throttle 1
hold gamepad steer -0.5
@80 hold gamepad steer 0
@60 shot b15_c_060
@90 shot b15_c_090
@105 shot b15_c_105
@120 shot b15_c_120
@135 shot b15_c_135
@150 shot b15_c_150
@180 shot b15_c_180
@210 shot b15_c_210
@240 shot b15_c_240
release gamepad
1.0 exit
